<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a Dunhill Cup soccer tournament match on Monday:  Zimbabwe    2     Bosnia     2   (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Zimbabwe - Masimba Dinyero 24, Ian Gorowa 75</p>
<p>Bosnia - Asim Hrnjic 50, Dzelaludi Muharemovic 68.  </p>
<p>    Indonesia   1    Vietnam    0 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Indonesia - Widodo Putro 3.</p>
</text>
